# n-ary chain, n>2. Must LEFT-ASSOCIATE into binary steps via fresh roles
# (SPEC 6.3): r1 o r2 subseteq f1, f1 o r3 subseteq t.

@prefix :    <http://example.org/t#> .
@prefix owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdf:  <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd:  <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

<http://example.org/t> a owl:Ontology .
:r1 a owl:ObjectProperty . :r2 a owl:ObjectProperty . :r3 a owl:ObjectProperty .
:t  a owl:ObjectProperty .
:t owl:propertyChainAxiom ( :r1 :r2 :r3 ) .
